1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
This figure did not begin in purple.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,000
There was a warmer body underneath.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:16,000
In this session, purple starts
to cross the earlier colour.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:21,000
The green room stays around it.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:28,000
The finished painting carries traces
of more than one state.
